@startuml
' Smart LMS: conceptual persistence-oriented class diagram, reviewed 2026-10-06.
' W2_ONLY selects the W2 view; the full diagram is standalone.
!pragma layout smetana
hide methods
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<W2>> #E8F3FF
!ifdef W2_ONLY
title Smart LMS - W2: LMS skeleton and ingestion
!else
title Smart LMS - Full product class diagram
!endif
legend left
  Blue / <<W2>>: prioritize in W2; not evidence of implementation.
  FK labels identify foreign keys; nullable relations use 0..1.
  PK = id: UUID. Money = Decimal, never Float.
  State fields are closed values listed in notes, not arbitrary strings.
  Relations do not prescribe ON DELETE CASCADE.
endlegend
